  terrain: Collapsed buildings, cratered streets, shattered overpasses, unstable rubble, burned vehicles, broken roads, and fractured utility lines.
  vegetation: Sparse weeds, dead trees, and overgrowth.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: AA guns, radar, bunkers. Urban: ruins, collapsed towers, vehicles, debris. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, drones.'
  effects: Smoke, dust, fire, sparks, falling debris, and structural collapse.
  audio: Explosions, rubble impacts, machinery, and radio chatter.
